      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INDAMOUSE (2) gets the strongest push after finishing only 1.7L away in a Saturday maiden at Eagle Farm, making solid inroads from well back on soft ground. His Doomben second before that, when well supported and beaten just over a length, gives the form line enough depth for this easier assignment. WURZBURG (3) is the main danger, having improved sharply at Eagle Farm when third to Win Star after an awkward start and some keenness. The 3kg claim adds to his third-up profile. WASAI (1) has placed at three straight runs and can be included again, though he was beaten as a well-supported favourite at Beaudesert after racing wide. CHANCE DE LUNE (7) brings honest Eagle Farm form and weight relief, but the 16-start maiden record keeps him more in the place-and-exotics bracket. BLOOD RED (6) continues to leave himself with too much to do but could get involved if they overdo it in front.",
